Open and read the referenced plan, verify its critical assumptions against source, and implement only the approved scope. For a bug, reproduce narrowly when safe or confirm the causal trace before editing. Follow the plan's evidence strategy: witness a focused regression or contract test fail for the intended reason when feasible, use characterization coverage for risky refactors, and do not manufacture tests for prose or mechanical configuration. After the last mutation, run fresh focused validation, broaden it in proportion to blast radius, and inspect the current diff. Never weaken an assertion merely to make checks pass. Do not commit or push. Return a compact handoff with changes, commands, exit status or direct results, decisions, limitations, and residual risks.

